+# TLS certificate verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is enabled on all builds, development builds included, and the project's current recorded decision is that HTTPS is used everywhere with no exceptions, so no build type and no host, internal hosts included, is exempt from verification or allowed to fall back to plain HTTP.
